  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender gap action &#x2013; enabling equal opportunities for girls and young women in North Macedonia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Work with the national youth network to support girls and young women in North Macedonia to become more active in society, to overcome the gender roles of the patriarchal society and to have equal access to opportunities in the private sector, public and political life, and in decision-making processes at local and national level.</narrative>
  </description>
